WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.152
Two pop-ups. One stockroom.

2
00:00:02.602 --> 00:00:05.820
The Dispossessed has one copy. Which crate gets it?

3
00:00:06.270 --> 00:00:11.881
Crate uses live Qloo evidence to connect each programme with books already in stock.

4
00:00:12.781 --> 00:00:16.685
Then it packs both stalls without promising the same copy twice.

5
00:00:17.135 --> 00:00:20.826
Now that copy sells out. Soul and City is already packed.

6
00:00:21.276 --> 00:00:23.558
Keep it locked. Repair the other crate.

7
00:00:24.008 --> 00:00:27.827
Kindred takes the open slot. The other seven placements stay.

8
00:00:28.277 --> 00:00:29.941
Good books. The right crowd.

9
00:00:30.391 --> 00:00:32.695
Crate. Developed by Ajnas N B.
